527	        `<details class="start-seed"><summary>调整这三天的顾客安排（可选）</summary><label>种子编号 <input id="seed-input" type="number" min="1" max="2147483647" step="1" value="${state.seed}" aria-label="顾客安排种子"></label></details>`+
528	        '<div class="goal-strip"><span>三天完整试玩</span><span><kbd>P</kbd> 随时暂停 · 自动存档</span></div>';
